"{path} looks like a LoRA adapter (from `mb train --model-type "
"image_generation_lora`), not a full model checkpoint — `mb export bundle` "
"doesn't apply to it. It's already a portable safetensors artifact, usable "
"directly (e.g. a diffusers pipeline's load_lora_weights())."
msgstr ""
"{path} 看起来像 LoRA 适配器 (来自 `mb train --model-type image_generation_lora`), "
"而不是完整的模型检查点 — `mb export bundle` 不适用。它已是可移植的 safetensors 产物, 可直接使用 (例如 "
"diffusers 流水线的 load_lora_weights())。"

